### Create a new doodad
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doodads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Doodad",
  "description": "A test doodad for API testing",
  "image": "test-doodad.jpg",
  "price": 19.99
}

### Get all doodads
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doodads

### Get all doodads
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doodads?page=1&size=5

### Get doodad by ID (replace 1 with an actual ID after creating)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doodads/1

### Update a doodad (replace 1 with an actual ID after creating)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doodads/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Doodad",
  "description": "An updated doodad",
  "image": "updated-test-doodad.jpg",
  "price": 29.99
}

### Filter doodads by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doodads?name=updated

### Filter doodads by description
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doodads?description=updated

### Filter doodads by name and description
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/doodads?name=updated&description=updated